        "content": "{\n  \"quantitative_comparisons\": [],\n  \"usable_content\": \"根据提供的材料，FMT-LUMINate试验（P0583）目前仅报道了客观缓解率（ORR）、安全性及微生物组特征等中期或初步结果。具体而言，NSCLC队列的ORR为80%，黑色素瘤队列的ORR为75%。虽然该研究在“Extended Data Fig. 2”中展示了无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）的Kaplan-Meier估计曲线，但文本摘要和主要结果部分并未提供具体的OS数值、中位生存时间或统计显著性数据。相比之下，另一项关于黑色素瘤的MIMic试验（P0577）则明确报告了长期的OS数据（中位OS为52.8个月）。因此，基于现有材料，无法确认FMT-LUMINate试验的最终OS数据是否已公布或具体数值为何。\",\n  \"decision\": \"external_research\",\n  \"still_missing\": \"FMT-LUMINate试验（P0583）的具体总生存期（OS）数值、中位生存时间及最终随访结果。\",\n  \"read_focus\": \"需要查找P0583（FMT-LUMINate）全文中关于Overall Survival (OS)的具体统计数据，或确认该研究是否已在其他出版物中发布了最终的生存分析结果。\",\n  \"external_ask\": \"检索FMT-LUMINate试验（NCT编号若可知更佳，或作者团队后续发表文章）是否已发布包含最终总生存期（OS）数据的完整结果或长期随访报告。\",\n  \"reason\": \"当前材料P0583仅提供了ORR和生存曲线的图示描述，未给出OS的具体量化结果；而问题明确要求确认“最终OS数据是否已公布”，需通过外部检索确认该特定研究的最终生存结局数据。\"\n}",
        "reasoning_content": "Here's a thinking process:\n\n1.  **Analyze User Input:**\n    - **Gap ID:** N9ae5308936be\n    - **Intended Use:** mechanism\n    - **Local Search:** Found true, 6 papers seen.\n    - **Material Found:**\n        - P0583 (Extended data): Trial design, survival curves (PFS/OS for NSCLC & melanoma), donor metagenomic profiling, association with irAEs. Mentions Kaplan-Meier estimates for PFS and OS.\n        - P0583 (work summary): Multi-center, open-label phase 2 trial (FMT-LUMINate). NSCLC (n=20) ORR 80%, Melanoma (n=20) ORR 75%. Safety: NSCLC no grade ≥3 AEs, Melanoma had early severe irAEs (myocarditis) linked to specific donor microbiome. Mechanism: Responders didn't gain donor strains but cleared harmful bacteria (Enterocloster, Clostridium), reducing tryptophan metabolism and improving systemic immune microenvironment.\n        - P0360 (Supplementary Materials & review planning): About gynecologic cancers, antibiotics, ICI. Not directly about FMT-LUMINate OS.\n        - P0577 (Results): MIMic trial (melanoma, n=20). Reports mPFS 29.6 months, mOS 52.8 months. Follow-up >40 months. Compares responders vs non-responders, FT vs NFT. Discusses microbiome shifts.\n    - **Paper Context:**\n        - P0583: FMT-LUMINate trial. NSCLC ORR 80%, Melanoma ORR 75%. Mentions safety, engraftment, microbiome shift. Sections include \"Results / FMT increases clinical activity...\", \"Results / Engraftment of donor-specific Prevotella spp...\", \"Results / Post-FMT shift...\". Does it explicitly state final OS data is published? The context mentions \"Kaplan-Meier estimates for patients in the NSCLC cohort for A. Progression-free survival and B. Overall survival.\" and \"Kaplan-Meier estimates for patients in the melanoma cohort for C. Progression-free survival and D. Overall survival.\" This implies OS data exists in the paper/supplement.\n        - P0360: Gynecologic cancer, antibiotics. Irrelevant to FMT-LUMINate OS.\n        - P0577: MIMic trial